WEBVTT

1
00:02:24.083 --> 00:02:25.125
In these five verses

2
00:02:25.125 --> 00:02:27.041
of Chapter 11,

3
00:02:27.041 --> 00:02:30.625
Sanjaya describes Arjun's overwhelming awe.

4
00:02:30.625 --> 00:02:33.000
After hearing Lord Krishna's words,

5
00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:35.916
Arjun is filled with wonder and fear.

6
00:02:35.916 --> 00:02:37.250
Sanjaya describes

7
00:02:37.250 --> 00:02:39.541
how Arjun is trembling,

8
00:02:39.541 --> 00:02:41.958
his voice faltering,

9
00:02:41.958 --> 00:02:45.666
as he bows before Lord Krishna again and again.

10
00:02:45.666 --> 00:02:47.541
Arjun now understands

11
00:02:47.541 --> 00:02:50.250
that Lord Krishna is the Supreme Lord,

12
00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:53.000
worshipped by the devas,

13
00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:56.250
and feared by the demons.

14
00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:59.541
Overwhelmed by Lord Krishna's infinite power,

15
00:02:59.541 --> 00:03:00.625
recognising Him as the

16
00:03:00.625 --> 00:03:03.750
supreme shelter of the universe,

17
00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:06.166
Arjun offers his prayers.

18
00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.833
Sanjaya describes

19
00:03:12.833 --> 00:03:16.916
Arjun's response to Lord Krishna's revelation.

20
00:03:16.916 --> 00:03:19.333
Arjun, a fearless warrior,

21
00:03:19.333 --> 00:03:22.500
renowned for his unwavering resolve,

22
00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:23.916
is now trembling.

23
00:03:23.916 --> 00:03:26.666
His hands join in reverence.

24
00:03:26.666 --> 00:03:31.250
His voice, once firm, now wavers.

25
00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:33.458
The grandeur and vastness

26
00:03:33.458 --> 00:03:36.750
of the Viraat Vishwarupa overwhelm him,

27
00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:38.666
filling him with the awareness

28
00:03:38.666 --> 00:03:41.000
of Lord Krishna's supremacy.

29
00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:42.291
No longer seeing Lord Krishna

30
00:03:42.291 --> 00:03:45.333
only as a friend,

31
00:03:45.333 --> 00:03:47.875
Arjun bows again and again,

32
00:03:47.875 --> 00:03:50.791
in complete surrender.

33
00:03:50.791 --> 00:03:52.625
Arjun then expresses

34
00:03:52.625 --> 00:03:54.416
how Lord Krishna's presence

35
00:03:54.416 --> 00:03:57.958
affects different beings.

36
00:03:57.958 --> 00:04:01.000
He says devotees rejoice

37
00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:03.041
and become drawn to Him,

38
00:04:03.041 --> 00:04:04.708
while the demons,

39
00:04:04.708 --> 00:04:09.666
unable to bear His glory, flee in terror.

40
00:04:09.666 --> 00:04:12.250
The Siddhas, understanding

41
00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:15.333
His true nature, bow before Him.

42
00:04:15.333 --> 00:04:19.625
This contrast deepens Arjun's realisation.

43
00:04:19.625 --> 00:04:22.250
Lord Krishna's influence is all-pervading,

44
00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:25.166
and every being responds according

45
00:04:25.166 --> 00:04:27.000
to its own nature.

46
00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:30.208
He recognises Lord Krishna
as greater even than Brahma,

47
00:04:30.208 --> 00:04:32.541
who creates the universe.

48
00:04:32.541 --> 00:04:35.541
If Brahma, who gives life to all,

49
00:04:35.541 --> 00:04:37.500
is created by Lord Krishna,

50
00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:40.750
then who would not bow before Him?

51
00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:43.375
Lord Krishna is beyond material existence

52
00:04:43.375 --> 00:04:45.208
and is the supreme shelter.

53
00:04:45.208 --> 00:04:47.416
Unlike the temporary world,

54
00:04:47.416 --> 00:04:51.000
He remains eternal and unchanging.

55
00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:52.500
This realisation fills Arjun

56
00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:55.750
with even deeper reverence.

57
00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:56.666
Arjun sees Lord Krishna

58
00:04:56.666 --> 00:04:59.625
in all aspects of creation.

59
00:04:59.625 --> 00:05:03.000
He is Vayu, Agni, Varuna, Chandra,

60
00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:07.166
and even Brahma, the first being.

61
00:05:07.166 --> 00:05:09.208
Lord Krishna is not merely

62
00:05:09.208 --> 00:05:10.625
a powerful being.

63
00:05:10.625 --> 00:05:13.000
He pervades everything.

64
00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:15.958
Arjun, grasping this all-pervasiveness,

65
00:05:15.958 --> 00:05:18.250
offers endless salutations,

66
00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:19.916
acknowledging

67
00:05:19.916 --> 00:05:21.291
that Lord Krishna's form

68
00:05:21.291 --> 00:05:25.666
extends beyond time and space.

69
00:05:25.666 --> 00:05:28.250
His surrender becomes complete.

70
00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:31.250
He bows from all directions,

71
00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:33.833
from the front, behind, and everywhere,

72
00:05:33.833 --> 00:05:35.041
understanding

73
00:05:35.041 --> 00:05:38.250
that Lord Krishna's presence is boundless.

74
00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:41.000
Arjun, who once saw Lord Krishna

75
00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:43.291
as a dear companion,

76
00:05:43.291 --> 00:05:47.000
now sees Him as the supreme master of all.

77
00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:49.541
Recognising His immeasurable power

78
00:05:49.541 --> 00:05:52.375
and infinite presence,

79
00:05:52.375 --> 00:05:56.083
Arjun's prayers are filled with wonder, devotion,

80
00:05:56.083 --> 00:05:59.208
and complete surrender.

81
00:06:04.375 --> 00:06:07.250
The things you admire

82
00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:11.458
and love, those interests of yours,

83
00:06:11.458 --> 00:06:15.000
shape your personality.

84
00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:18.958
Does your mind ever wonder,

85
00:06:18.958 --> 00:06:22.041
'Whom should I admire?

86
00:06:22.041 --> 00:06:24.750
Where should I draw inspiration?'

87
00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:28.333
See, whoever you admire,

88
00:06:28.333 --> 00:06:31.791
you begin to become like them.

89
00:06:31.791 --> 00:06:33.500
Just as Arjun,

90
00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:38.208
recognising My greatness,
became connected to Me,

91
00:06:38.208 --> 00:06:41.458
you too become connected to the qualities

92
00:06:41.458 --> 00:06:44.250
and people you admire.

93
00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:46.083
You connect with them.

94
00:06:46.083 --> 00:06:49.291
If you constantly admire wealth,

95
00:06:49.291 --> 00:06:53.583
fame, or power,

96
00:06:53.583 --> 00:06:57.541
your mind will run toward those things,

97
00:06:57.541 --> 00:07:02.458
shaping your values accordingly.

98
00:07:02.458 --> 00:07:05.208
But if you admire kindness,

99
00:07:05.208 --> 00:07:06.416
honesty,

100
00:07:06.416 --> 00:07:10.125
knowledge, and devotion,

101
00:07:10.125 --> 00:07:13.958
those qualities will begin to grow within you.

102
00:07:13.958 --> 00:07:17.250
So think once

103
00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:20.375
about the people and things

104
00:07:20.375 --> 00:07:23.041
you admire.

105
00:07:23.041 --> 00:07:25.791
Are they leading you

106
00:07:25.791 --> 00:07:29.958
toward a life of purpose and peace,

107
00:07:29.958 --> 00:07:34.750
or pulling you toward temporary pleasures?

108
00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:38.291
What is great and eternally true,

109
00:07:38.291 --> 00:07:42.000
the more you admire it,

110
00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:43.916
the more your mind

111
00:07:43.916 --> 00:07:47.875
aligns with those qualities.

112
00:07:47.875 --> 00:07:50.458
This is why spiritual

113
00:07:50.458 --> 00:07:54.291
practice is so powerful.

114
00:07:54.291 --> 00:07:58.250
It connects you to higher qualities.

115
00:07:58.250 --> 00:08:00.958
Your thoughts and actions

116
00:08:00.958 --> 00:08:03.625
rise to a higher level.

117
00:08:03.625 --> 00:08:05.000
So,

118
00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:08.875
choose your inspirations carefully.

119
00:08:08.875 --> 00:08:11.166
By admiring goodness,

120
00:08:11.166 --> 00:08:13.916
compassion, and truth,

121
00:08:13.916 --> 00:08:16.375
you shape your own character

122
00:08:16.375 --> 00:08:18.625
into one

123
00:08:18.625 --> 00:08:22.083
that embodies those values,

124
00:08:22.083 --> 00:08:25.458
values that bring deep fulfilment

125
00:08:25.458 --> 00:08:27.500
and purpose to life.

126
00:08:32.333 --> 00:08:35.458
In a family, respect

127
00:08:35.458 --> 00:08:38.791
should never be demanded.

128
00:08:38.791 --> 00:08:40.916
When you work with love,

129
00:08:40.916 --> 00:08:44.000
sacrifice, and care,

130
00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:46.916
respect comes

131
00:08:46.916 --> 00:08:49.875
on its own.

132
00:08:49.875 --> 00:08:52.416
Just as Arjun

133
00:08:52.416 --> 00:08:56.750
offered respect upon recognising My greatness,

134
00:08:56.750 --> 00:09:00.416
so too, when we do good

135
00:09:00.416 --> 00:09:03.166
and selfless work,

136
00:09:03.166 --> 00:09:06.416
people give us respect.

137
00:09:06.416 --> 00:09:10.916
Focus on fulfilling your family duties

138
00:09:10.916 --> 00:09:15.791
with love and patience.

139
00:09:15.791 --> 00:09:17.333
Parents who raise

140
00:09:17.333 --> 00:09:20.500
their children with love

141
00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:23.333
receive their respect.

142
00:09:23.333 --> 00:09:28.000
Spouses who support each other

143
00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:31.750
receive each other's respect.

144
00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:34.958
When family members work with love

145
00:09:34.958 --> 00:09:37.750
and dedication,

146
00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:42.000
respect comes naturally.

147
00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:46.375
This creates an environment

148
00:09:46.375 --> 00:09:52.125
where everyone honours one another.

149
00:09:52.125 --> 00:09:56.833
And importantly, this respect

150
00:09:56.833 --> 00:10:01.541
is not given under any pressure, but

151
00:10:01.541 --> 00:10:06.625
is genuine, heartfelt respect,

152
00:10:06.625 --> 00:10:09.958
given because of the support

153
00:10:09.958 --> 00:10:13.416
and care each offers the other.

154
00:10:13.416 --> 00:10:18.125
Do your work with integrity,

155
00:10:18.125 --> 00:10:20.250
and respect will come

156
00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:21.833
to you on its own.

157
00:10:26.583 --> 00:10:29.000
In professional life,

158
00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:32.333
recognising the strengths of others

159
00:10:32.333 --> 00:10:35.208
and appreciating them

160
00:10:35.208 --> 00:10:39.375
does not diminish your own abilities.

161
00:10:39.375 --> 00:10:40.416
Rather,

162
00:10:40.416 --> 00:10:45.208
it reflects confidence and maturity.

163
00:10:45.208 --> 00:10:47.041
Just as Arjun,

164
00:10:47.041 --> 00:10:51.708
himself a great warrior,

165
00:10:51.708 --> 00:10:54.875
upon recognising My greatness,

166
00:10:54.875 --> 00:10:58.333
offered respect without hesitation,

167
00:10:58.333 --> 00:11:02.208
you too should acknowledge the skills

168
00:11:02.208 --> 00:11:06.458
and achievements of your colleagues.

169
00:11:06.458 --> 00:11:11.875
When you see excellence in someone's work,

170
00:11:11.875 --> 00:11:15.500
do not see it as a threat,

171
00:11:15.500 --> 00:11:19.250
but appreciate their talent.

172
00:11:19.250 --> 00:11:21.416
Praising others

173
00:11:21.416 --> 00:11:24.208
builds positive relationships

174
00:11:24.208 --> 00:11:28.166
and fosters team unity.

175
00:11:28.166 --> 00:11:29.750
It shows

176
00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:33.875
that you value excellence,

177
00:11:33.875 --> 00:11:37.583
whoever demonstrates it.

178
00:11:37.583 --> 00:11:40.416
Some people hesitate

179
00:11:40.416 --> 00:11:43.791
to praise others, fearing

180
00:11:43.791 --> 00:11:46.916
that it may make them appear

181
00:11:46.916 --> 00:11:50.416
less capable by comparison.

182
00:11:50.416 --> 00:11:54.541
But true professionals understand

183
00:11:54.541 --> 00:11:58.500
that honouring the strengths of others

184
00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:03.000
enhances their own credibility

185
00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:06.208
and creates an environment of mutual growth.

186
00:12:06.208 --> 00:12:10.041
Whether it is a junior colleague

187
00:12:10.041 --> 00:12:13.166
with fresh ideas,

188
00:12:13.166 --> 00:12:15.416
or a senior

189
00:12:15.416 --> 00:12:17.791
with years of experience,

190
00:12:17.791 --> 00:12:20.041
genuine appreciation

191
00:12:20.041 --> 00:12:24.500
strengthens both personal relationships

192
00:12:24.500 --> 00:12:26.958
and workplace culture.

193
00:12:26.958 --> 00:12:31.708
Success is never a solitary journey.

194
00:12:31.708 --> 00:12:34.625
Learning from the strengths of others

195
00:12:34.625 --> 00:12:37.416
and celebrating them

196
00:12:37.416 --> 00:12:41.041
helps you grow

197
00:12:41.041 --> 00:12:44.666
and creates a more collaborative

198
00:12:44.666 --> 00:12:48.541
and productive environment at work.

199
00:12:48.541 --> 00:12:49.666
Remember this.
